ite-multicol-table-wrap\" style=\"margin:0 -15px;\">\n<table class=\"wsite-multicol-table\">\n<tbody class=\"wsite-multicol-tbody\">\n<tr class=\"wsite-multicol-tr\">\n<td class=\"wsite-multicol-col\" id=\"997434235215848029-col0\" style=\"width:50%; padding:0 15px;\">\n<ul class=\"columnlist\" id=\"997434235215848029-col0-ul\">\n<li class=\"inside\" id=\"inside_772718936550825394\">\n<div class=\"element-box\">\n<div class=\"element-box-contents\">\n<h2 class=\"element wsite-content-title editable-text\" id=\"256691983384097246\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none; font-style:normal; font-weight:400; \"><span style=\" font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">101年3月30日，大溪國中第二屆魔術方塊競賽報導，徐展鴻神奇快手！</span></span></span></h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"inside\" id=\"inside_577301871712558252\">\n<div class=\"element-box\">\n<div class=\"element-box-contents\">\n<div class=\"element wsite-youtube\" id=\"111177131527835225\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:10px;\"><div class=\"wsite-youtube-wrapper wsite-youtube-size-auto wsite-youtube-align-center\">\n<div class=\"wsite-youtube-container\">\n<weebly dont_include=\"\">\n</weebly>\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/e0_aRabUW_M?wmode=opaque\" title=\"影片區影片\"></iframe>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td><td class=\"wsite-multicol-col\" id=\"997434235215848029-col1\" style=\"width:50%; padding:0 15px;\">\n<ul class=\"columnlist\" id=\"997434235215848029-col1-ul\">\n<li class=\"inside\" id=\"inside_604935580119171144\">\n<div class=\"element-box\">\n<div class=\"element-box-contents\">\n<h2 class=\"element wsite-content-title editable-text\" id=\"121942441504085668\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none; font-style:normal; font-weight:400; \"><span style=\" font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\" font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">2012大溪國中第二屆魔術方塊大賽</span><br/><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">前六強的版圖已經有所不同了，</span><br/><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">精彩的賽事，</span><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">又讓我們記錄下來了！</span><br/><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">請大家耐心觀賞囉！</span><br/><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">本片入圍2012桃園影展</span><br/><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">內容簡介：</span><br/><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">這一次，風雲再起，</span><br/><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">上屆魔術方塊大賽的選手們變得更快，</span><br/><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">目標突破自己，</span><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">不過，似乎有個厲害的傢伙，</span><br/><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">立志捲土重來，</span><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">重返榮耀，</span><br/><span style=\"font: 13px/17px arial, sans-serif; text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">勝利女神的微笑到底是屬於誰的呢?</span></span></span></span></h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"inside\" id=\"inside_501862451797196237\">\n<div class=\"element-box\">\n<div class=\"element-box-contents\">\n<div class=\"element wsite-youtube\" id=\"177764186293562724\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:10px;\"><div class=\"wsite-youtube-wrapper wsite-youtube-size-auto wsite-youtube-align-center\">\n<div class=\"wsite-youtube-container\">\n<weebly dont_include=\"\">\n</weebly>\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rW3PHaCXZr4?wmode=opaque\" title=\"影片區影片\"></iframe>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td> </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"inside\" id=\"inside_359800444462776838\">\n<div class=\"element-box\">\n<div class=\"element-box-contents\">\n<div class=\"element\" id=\"472352121593944815\"><div style=\" overflow: hidden; width: 100%;\"></div>\n<hr class=\"styled-hr\" style=\"width:100%;\"/>\n<div style=\" overflow: hidden; width: 100%;\"></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"inside wsite-text\" id=\"inside_535598884832426449\">\n<div class=\"element-box\">\n<div class=\"element-box-contents\">\n<div class=\"element paragraph editable-text\" id=\"880116044761363350\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none; font-style:normal; font-weight:400; \"><span style=\" font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none;\"><font><font><font><font><font><font><font><font>DSJH </font></font></font></font></font></font><font><font><font><font><font><font><font><font>數學領域</font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font><font><font><font><font><font><font>教學網</font></font></font></font></font></font></span></span>--